ther and a handful of orphaned allies to survive, while Amicia begins to realize that the Inquisition's interest in Hugo may be connected to something far darker than the plague itself.", "summary": "A Plague Tale: Innocence is a third-person action-adventure game set in 14th-century France during the Black Death. Players control Amicia, a young girl protecting her little brother Hugo as they flee the Inquisition and navigate environments overrun by swarms of plague rats. Gameplay combines stealth, puzzle-solving, and light combat, with an emphasis on using fire and light to manage the rat hordes.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 22, "name": "Historical"}, {"id": 23, "name": "Stealth"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/a-plague-tale-innocence", "videos": [{"id": 26815, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "YlL5F3O1MAQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YlL5F3O1MAQ", "title": "A Plague Tale: Innocence - Uncut Gameplay Trailer | PS4", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/YlL5F3O1MAQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 51287, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Evv-ECAk35g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Evv-ECAk35g", "title": "A Plague Tale: Innocence - 4K UHD for PS5 & Xbox Series X | cloud version on Nintendo Switch", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Evv-ECAk35g/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 20718, "name": "E3 2018 Trailer", "video_id": "xkD0GO0NqsQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xkD0GO0NqsQ", "title": "A Plague Tale: Innocence - E3 2018 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xkD0GO0NqsQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 21818, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "djmHcNBe1Z4", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=djmHcNBe1Z4", "title": "[GAMESCOM 2018] A  Plague Tale: Innocence - Uncut Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/djmHcNBe1Z4/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 25958, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "sEu7k4OeyPM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sEu7k4OeyPM", "title